 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2/ops.cu      | 26 +++++++++++++++++
 zig/src/families/inkling2/engine.zig  | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 zig/src/families/inkling2/forward.zig | 29 ++++++++++++++++---
 zig/src/families/inkling2/ops.zig     | 17 ++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 105 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

